37
00:03:35.173 --> 00:03:36.591
-Ito ay ang aking personal na buhay!
-MS. Nam.

38
00:03:36.674 --> 00:03:38.801
Ito ay aking personal na buhay!

39
00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:41.387
Papayag ka ba sa isang paternity test?

40
00:03:43.598 --> 00:03:45.391
Kailan nagsimula ang affair?

41
00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:47.644
-MS. Cha, okay ka lang?
-MS. Cha!

42
00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:50.230
Nagkaroon ng car accident dito.
Mangyaring dumating mabilis!

43
