sa bugging him, it will be a hard fight.

634
00:51:52.400 --> 00:51:54.194
Sinasabi mo bang long shot ito?

635
00:51:59.533 --> 00:52:01.117
Ang sabi ko kailangan nating lumaban.

636
00:52:01.701 --> 00:52:03.620
Balikan mo kung gaano ka natamaan,

637
00:52:03.703 --> 00:52:05.247
